	(text "Battery input and regulators" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 12 0) (effects (font (size 4 4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c25b58e1-e67a-58ef-ad67-3f19c28e25e2"))
	(text "Battery current path: J9 -> R6 (0.2 mOhm shunt, Kelvin sense pads 2/3) -> VBAT plane -> ports.\nINA226 at I2C 0x40. D5 clamps spikes on VBAT. 5 V buck (LMR33630) feeds the ports' 5 V rail.\nVSYS = 5 V through D6 or USB through D1 (io page): feeds the 3.3 V buck (TLV62569), the sensor LDO\nand the GPS / TELEM / RC connectors, so USB never reaches the 5 V port rail or the battery side.\nNo reverse-polarity protection on this revision." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.7 1.7)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2adf91cc-667b-5efa-8146-fb153d4d8b3a"))
